  "body": "﻿## What changed\n\n- Updated `push_missing_fields` in `crates/app/src/mcp/job.rs` to inject the 10 `WireContourDto` fields that serialization skips (`condition`, `start`, `tabs`, `capture`, `taper_deg`, `burnout_clearance`, `clearance`, `skims`, `four_axis`, `sharp_corners`), so `list_operation_types` returns all 13 fields together with `top_z`, `bottom_z`, and `side`.\n- Updated `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` to state live Wire Contour behavior: `\"mounts_tool\": true` requiring a `Wire` tool (`EDM-W025`), built-in wire machines (`Sodick ALC400G`, `AGIECUT Classic 2S (template)`), all three wire post processors (`\"Generic ISO Wire EDM\"`, `\"Sodick Wire EDM (Mark 21)\"`, and `\"Agie native wire EDM\"` with condition `AGIE_QN2` on `AGIECUT Classic 2S (template)`), open/closed sides, and all 13 fields.\n- Added `list_operation_types_and_skill_match_wire_contour_dto_and_tool_law` to `crates/app/tests/mcp_wire_contour.rs` to pin `list_operation_types`, the skill file (including all three wire posts and `AGIE_QN2`), `Wire` tool requirements, and MCP edits.\n\n## Verification\n\n- All checks below ran on final head `2726446c4c7954179724877203d1be0f8f5c117c` via separate `gate-runner`:\n  - `cargo test -j 8 -p camcraft-app --test mcp_doc_drift --test mcp_wire_contour`: passed (`mcp_doc_drift`: 6 passed, 0 failed; `mcp_wire_contour`: 8 passed, 0 failed).\n  - `cargo clippy -j 8 -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed (exit 0).\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick` (`CAMCRAFT_GATE_JOBS=8`): passed (`24 step(s), 0 failed`, wall 3.0 min, including `app:lib` and 22 `camcraft-app` integration suites).\n- Trial merge against `upstream/main` (`6e641dac7`): clean (`git merge-tree --write-tree` exit 0).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Running posted NC output from `\"Generic ISO Wire EDM\"`, `\"Sodick Wire EDM (Mark 21)\"`, or `\"Agie native wire EDM\"` on a physical wire EDM control.\n\nProcess change: yes\nfork synced at v0.25.0\nChangelog: MCP `list_operation_types` and `camcraft-mcp` skill report live Wire Contour fields, mounts_tool, machines and all three wire posts.\nEffort: low\n\nFixes #3217\r\n",
